      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Waterfall Contacts — Storeleads → Supersoniq",
        "formDescription": "Pull store domains straight from the Storeleads API (no CSV). Supersoniq then pulls decision-makers at those stores into the client's ClayRoots build table. Country applies to both sides: the stores (Storeleads) and the contacts (Supersoniq). Max companies is the hard spend cap: companies pulled x contacts per company = Supersoniq credits. Targeting defaults overshoot on purpose; narrow only if you mean to.",
